    "statementHTML": "<div class=\"statement-body\">\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-goal\">\n   <h2><span class=\"icon icon-goal\">&nbsp;</span><span>Goal </span></h2>\n   <span class=\"question-statement\">You are looking at a digital clock through a mirror.<br><br>When reflected, the order of the digits is reversed and each digit is transformed according to the following rules:<br><br>&bull; Digit <const>0</const> remains <const>0</const><br>&bull; Digit <const>1</const> remains <const>1</const><br>&bull; Digit <const>2</const> becomes <const>5</const><br>&bull; Digit <const>5</const> becomes <const>2</const><br>&bull; Digit <const>8</const> remains <const>8</const><br><br>You are given the mirrored time. <strong>Output the real time.</strong></span>\n</div>\n<div class=\"statement-section statement-protocol\">\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-input\"><strong>Line 1: </strong> A string representing the mirrored <var>time</var> in the format <var>MM</var>:<var>HH</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Output</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-output\">The <strong>real time</strong> in the format <var>HH</var>:<var>MM</var>.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Constraints</div>\n      <div class=\"question-statement-constraints\"><var>time</var> contains only the digits <const>0</const>, <const>1</const>, <const>2</const>, <const>5</const> and <const>8</const>.<br><br>All input times are reflections of valid 24-hour times.</div>\n   </div>\n   <div class=\"blk\">\n      <div class=\"title\">Example</div>\n      <div class=\"statement-inout\">\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-in\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Input</div>\n            <pre class=\"question-statement-example-in\">05:81</pre>\n         </div>\n         <div class=\"statement-inout-out\">\n            <div class=\"title\">Output</div>